config BR2_PACKAGE_RSOS_UCITY
	bool "rsos-ucity"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_RSOS_HOMEBREW # rsos-seed-homebrew copies the game
	help
	  µCity 1.2 (Antonio Niño Díaz), an open-source city builder
	  for the Game Boy Color, pre-installed so that the "gbc"
	  system has a game out of the box. Code GPL-3.0+, GBT Player
	  BSD-2-Clause, graphics and music CC BY-SA 4.0.

	  Downloads the upstream v1.2 release ROM and the source of the
	  tag (for "make legal-info"), both hash-checked. Installs the
	  ROM to /usr/share/rsos/homebrew/gbc/ with a gamelist.xml, and
	  the licences and NOTICE to /usr/share/rsos/licenses/ucity/.
	  rsos-seed-homebrew (rsos-homebrew) copies the game to
	  /data/roms/gbc/ on the first boot. 128 KB.

	  https://github.com/AntonioND/ucity
	  See docs/homebrew.md.

comment "rsos-ucity needs rsos-homebrew (first-boot seeding)"
	depends on !BR2_PACKAGE_RSOS_HOMEBREW
